text = "[center][b][font_size=32]THE NIGHTMARE[/font_size][/b][/center]

After fleeing the outside world, you found an abandoned mansion and sought shelter for the night. 
Now, trapped in the dark, you realize you are not alone. 

[b]Bicho Papão is hunting you.[/b]

Find the key and escape through the main door. 
Do not let him catch you. With every strike, your fear grows and your light shrinks. 
If you fall into complete darkness, you sleep forever.


[center][pulse freq=1.0 color=#ffffff40][b]Press ENTER to continue...[/b][/pulse][/center]"
